{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“平坦概形态射”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"平坦概形态射"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 是平坦的是指, 对每个点 $x\\in X$,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal O_{Y,f(x)} \\to \\mathcal O_{X,x}\r\n$$\n都是"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦环同态","text":"平坦环同态"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}